@SeasonId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Players of a season, by name (take the id from GET /seasons; defaults: offset 0, limit 25)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/seasons/{{SeasonId}}/players
Accept: application/json

### Page through the players
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/seasons/{{SeasonId}}/players?offset=0&limit=10
Accept: application/json

### Search by words of the name: any order, case and diacritics ignored
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/seasons/{{SeasonId}}/players?q=kaczmarek lukasz
Accept: application/json

### Setters of the season: the position is the one from this season
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/seasons/{{SeasonId}}/players?position=setter
Accept: application/json

### Players of one roster of the season (take the id from GET /rosters?seasonId=)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/seasons/{{SeasonId}}/players?rosterId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### Descending by name
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/seasons/{{SeasonId}}/players?sort=-fullName
Accept: application/json

### Error: the season does not exist (404, unlike GET /players?seasonId= which returns an empty list)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/seasons/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/players
Accept: application/json

### Error: the season id is not a GUID (404, the route does not match)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/seasons/not-a-guid/players
Accept: application/json

### Error: unknown position (400)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/seasons/{{SeasonId}}/players?position=striker
Accept: application/json

### Error: unknown sort field (400, errors.sort)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/seasons/{{SeasonId}}/players?sort=heightCm
Accept: application/json

### Error: limit above the maximum of 100 (400, errors.limit)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/seasons/{{SeasonId}}/players?limit=1000
Accept: application/json

### Error: negative offset (400, errors.offset)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/seasons/{{SeasonId}}/players?offset=-1
Accept: application/json
